{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16954","headline":"顺宗至德大圣皇帝挽歌词三首 二 · 武元衡","name":"顺宗至德大圣皇帝挽歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"容卫晓徘徊，严城阊阖开。\n乌号龙驭远，遏密凤声哀。\n崑浪黄河注，崦嵫白日颓。\n恭闻天子孝，不忍望铜台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}